/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 171 Tm
(2. Presents this certificate to the agent \(the agent trusts the sandbox CA) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 150 Tm
(because it's injected into SSL_CERT_FILE, NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS, etc.\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 125 Tm
(3. Decrypts the HTTP request ? now the proxy sees plaintext HTTP) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 104 Tm
(4. Evaluates L7 policy rules against method + path) Tj
